 * Read an amount of bytes at a given offset from the right file of a
 * treefiles export. The read is limited to the block file containing
 * the offset, so data spanning multiple blocks requires multiple
 * calls. Block files that do not exist (or that are shorter than the
 * block size) read back as zeroes, as they have never been written.
 *
 * @param a The offset where the read should start
 * @param buf A buffer to read into
